nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;<i><u>SCRUM</u></i> - Desse m=C3=A9todo=
 segue os princ=C3=ADpios e&nbsp;<a href=3D"http://ppdswp.caixa/?glossary=
=3Dpraticas">pr=C3=A1ticas</a>&nbsp;gerenciais, o ciclo de vida (<a href=3D=
"http://ppds.caixa/wp-externo/biblioteca/Agil/disciplines/Sprint_FD4D7A96.h=
tml">Sprint</a>), os artefatos (burndown chart), os&nbsp;<a href=3D"http://=
